  "theory": {
    "incommensurable": "Cosine is bounded similarity; BM42 is an unbounded IDF-weighted sum. Raw addition is meaningless; each channel is mapped to a utility in [0,1] or to a rank kernel 1/(\u03ba+r).",
    "operators": "Convex mix = interchangeable utilities. CombMNZ / product / noisy-OR reward agreement (two independent likelihoods). ISR 1/r^2 concentrates on the head. A query gate moves the dense prior using top-1/top-2 margin, lexical BM42-ness, and top-10 overlap.",
    "logistic": "P(rel|d) \u2248 \u03c3(w\u00b7\u03c6) with \u03c6 = (minmax, RRF, overlap, product, log-rank, ISR) fit by weighted logistic regression on train candidates in the union of lists."
